  "circles.noFeeFullPot":   { en: "No organiser fee — collectors get the full pot", pidgin: "No organiser fee — collectors go collect the full pot", ha: "Babu kuɗin mai shiryawa — masu karɓa suna samun duka tukunyar", ig: "Enweghị ụgwọ onye nhazi — ndị na-anata na-enweta ego niile", yo: "Kò sí owó olùṣètò — àwọn tó ń gbà máa gba gbogbo owó náà" },
